DESCRIPTION:Sometimes / Always - 360 Experience / Minimal Techno Datum: 18.09.2026 | Einlass: 20:30 Uhr Beginn: 21:00 | Ende: 03:00 Uhr  Free Event TECHNO KITCHEN & and Beatconnection present A night built for the underground. Minimal grooves. Raw textures. Hypnotic rhythms. TECHNO KITCHEN takes over Rhitz for an intimate\, Boiler Room-inspired experience — DJs in the middle\, crowd all around\, no distance between the music and the people. Expect deep minimal techno\, rolling basslines\, stripped-back percussion and a sound system turned all the way up. No VIP energy. No unnecessary extras. Just music\, movement & people.
